Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:37.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,《疯狂的麦克斯3》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:29.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴特镇替大家打造美好明天）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（原子咖啡店）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.53,0:26:20.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（闪电擂台 现场过招）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:10.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（死亡 地下世界 大姨娘的选择）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:12.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（集中营 无罪开释 做苦工）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.68,0:39:14.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地下世界 截肢）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.94,1:42:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[献给拜伦]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正中红心 - 没错 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bull's-eye! - You bet, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.23,0:03:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会了 烂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sayonara, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有防腐剂 纯水\N{\fnArial\fs30}No preservatives, just pure water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,清凉干净的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, clear water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 过来啊 咱们做点交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, step up, schmuck, get some dealing done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖的是水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hay, that's my go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不懂吗？这是水 在这里没水活不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't you understand? This is water. You can't live without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射尘真要人命 是吧 祝你有个美好一天 来买水唷\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a little fallout, huh? Have a nice day! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去拿一袋谷物来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a sack of grain…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或提供两小时服务的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or a woman for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想交易什么？- 我要找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you trading? - I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要不要交易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trading or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他驾驶一车队骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was driving a team of camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是交易之地 赚点利润 做点生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}People come here to trade, make a little profit, do a little business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若没东西交易 就没资格来到巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've nothing to trade, you've got no business in Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要进去一小时就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour on the inside, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一个 - 我拿一身本领交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Next! - I got skills, I can trade them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 妓院人手已满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. The brothel's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你若找到他 然后呢？- 我会要求他物归原主\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And if you find him, what then? - I'll ask him to return what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 到时他一定会很想赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and of course he'll be desperate to clear his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真那么厉害？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you that good? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你的确有交易的本领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you've got something to trade after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就开口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿你二十四小时阳寿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four hours of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你将取回被偷走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, you'll get back what was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这交易不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是交易咱们谈谈 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not. Let's talk. Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器放在这里 这是法律规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave your weapons here. It's the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记住啦 就是这种交通工具… - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember, this is the vehicle… - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让底特律破产 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …that sent Detroit broke. - Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里拿到这些骆驼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get these animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的单峰骆驼 沙漠之舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glorious dromedary. The ship of the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有独立悬吊系统 动力方向操纵 没有排放控制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got independent suspension, power steering and no emission control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就把它们骑走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride them away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大姨娘 来了一位战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior, Aunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失去一切 寻觅一份交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost everything. Looking for a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他只是个邋遢不起眼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's just a raggedy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他动作灵敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ironbar…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…think he can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从前做过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you do before this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当过警察 司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a cop, a driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是风水轮流转啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how the world turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经风光一世 如今沦为阶下囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day cock of the walk, next, a feather duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤汤 弹奏悲伤曲调吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play something, Ton Ton. Something tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知道我从前是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名小卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在大限过后 我仍活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except on the day after, I was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名小卒便有机会闯出一份名堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This nobody had a chance to be somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲了这么多关于我的事 要喝点水吗？吃水果？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for history. Anyway… Water? Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你是第一位通过甄试的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You're the first to survive the audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看 先生 这些都是我造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, mister. All this I built.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,费尽千辛万苦打造而成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to my armpits in blood and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是一片沙漠 如今是一座城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there was desert, now there's a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经盗贼肆虐 如今银货两讫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there was robbery, there's trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经哀鸿遍野 如今一片生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there was despair, now there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意不计任何代价保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的代价是杀一个人 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today it's necessary to kill a man. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意付出什么代价？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重新给你装备 交通工具 牲畜 还有燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll re-equip you. Vehicles, animals. Fuel, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常优厚的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a generous offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么找上我？你有战士 有武器 你只要下令就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me? You've got warriors, you've got weapons. Just give the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面对的情况非比寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are dealing with subtleties here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是敌人 几乎像是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no enemy. It's almost family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真「文明」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see, real civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必管理由 只要负责行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reasons don't concern you, just the conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底同不同意协定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the deal or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 你绝对不能让任何人知道 你替大姨娘工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first is that no one knows you're working for Aunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出手击败他 然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit him, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 要公平打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second is, it's a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 必须致对方于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And third is, it's to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方叫地下世界 即巴特镇取得能源之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called it Underworld. It's where Bartertown gets its energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 石油或天然气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, oil, natural gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像那种猪？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean pigs like those? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗屎 - 是猪屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bullshit. - Pigshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 猪屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Pigshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,电灯 马达 交通工具…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights, the motors, the vehicles…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠一种叫沼气的高能量瓦斯运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all run by a high-powered gas called methane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而沼气来自猪屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Methane comes from pigshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看 你看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look. Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一只大猪扛着一只小猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a big guy giving a little guy a piggyback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王 他们是共同体\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster. They're a unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甚至有共同的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They even share the same name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小的那只叫老大 他出脑力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little one is called Master. He's the brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掌管地下世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个是爆炸王 他出劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one is Blaster. He's the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的组合阵容十分强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together they can be very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也很自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they are also arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要保住大脑 废掉身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to keep the brain, dump the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很壮 他有多强？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's big. How good is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哼一口气便能让人致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can beat most men with his breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要仔细瞧瞧他 我该怎么渗入？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a closer look at him. How do I get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是所工厂 去找份工作吧 - 我对沼气一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a factory, isn't it? Ask for work. - I know nothing about methane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会产屎吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shovel shit, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们来谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 自由人 来帮帮罪犯吧 你不想沦落到和我同样下场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, free man, come help a convict. You don't want to end up like me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被判关多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,终身监\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big one. Life. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为杀了一只猪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For killing a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得喂活我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to feed the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:18:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别替我担心 在这里终生监只有两三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, doesn't worry me. Down here life's two, three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个修理工黑手指在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that bum mechanic Blackfinger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we got a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,两磅炸弹 己准备好开炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve pounds of dynamite, all set to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦？你是专家 解除武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem? You expert! Disarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很高阶的工作 一个不小心 整个 地方就会被炸为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a class job. One mistake, it'll blow the crap out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是真的 - 快想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Literally. - Think what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹被接到一个计时器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, now, the dynamite is connected to the timing device…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被接到一个开关 我找不到这开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is connected to the switch, which I can't find…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那开关则接到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is connected to the, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}…battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就来切断电池 - 我可不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll disconnect the battery! - I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是麦克斯 - 你够聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me Max. - You smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 聪明让我行遍天下 - 解除武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my vehicle. - Disarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少钱？- 不交易 只做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much? - No trade. Do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我发号施令 我是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me order. Me Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我掌管巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me run Bartertown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以你们才会在屎堆打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, that's why you live in shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是屎 是能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not shit! Energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你怎么叫 闻起来还是屎臭冲天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Call it what you like, still smells like shit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是屎 是能源 没有能源就没有城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not shit! Energy! No energy, no town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿拉伯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me king Arab!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.77,0:20:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是小精灵仙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Me, fairy princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁止输出能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embargo, on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁止输出能源 关闭主阀门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embargo on! Main valve off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 现在又怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇由谁掌管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who run Bartertown?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我告诉过你 别再次禁止输出能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. I told you, no more embargoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再关更多 爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}More, Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇由谁掌管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who run Bartertown?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇由谁掌管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who run Bartertown?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.57,0:21:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王掌管巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster runs Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王掌管巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBlaster runs Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除禁止输出能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift embargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 重新排队 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, back in line. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.49,0:22:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要脚放在脸上？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want foot in face? - Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.29,0:22:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 你为啥事进来？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, mister. What are you laying for? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 我能感受到 色子开始滚动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mister, I can feel it. The dice are rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要骆驼 交通工具 食物 水 沼气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my camels, my vehicle, food, water, methane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 你说是公平过招\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deal. - Okay, you said a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 依据法律规定进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean by that? - As provided by the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.09,0:23:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunderdome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.77,0:24:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人赤手空拳过招 没有评审 不能重来 无法逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men, hand-to-hand. No jury, no appeal, no parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.17,0:24:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事情都可能发生 由机会决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything's possible. Chance decides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.74,0:24:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电擂台 我该如何上擂台？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunderdome. How do I get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 找个人单挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy. Pick a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.49,0:24:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝大家玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody have a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的交通工具 我要拿回它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my vehicle and I want it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.49,0:25:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不清楚 听起来像有人下命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearing wonky. Sounds like an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.05,0:25:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 这可不得了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Yumping Yesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.53,0:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他居然这么说 头壳坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him sad. Brain broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.80,0:25:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的交通工具 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This my vehicle. You…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是行人 继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pedestrian! Drive on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三秒钟 否则扭断你脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three seconds, break neck. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.95,0:25:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterBIaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.20,0:25:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵从法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.68,0:25:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大姨娘 有两人发生争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunty, two men in dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我们的目击证人 大姨娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}These our witness, Aunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.01,0:25:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被欺负了 要讨回公道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us suffer bad. Us want justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.11,0:26:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要闪电擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want Thunderdome!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.43,0:26:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道法律规定 是两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the law. Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸王出场 二十人进 只有他出\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Blaster. Twenty men enter, only him leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的决定了 闪电擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's your choice. Thunderdome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.39,0:26:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大姨娘 大姨娘 大姨娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunty! Aunty! Aunty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:27:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临闪电擂台比赛现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to another edition of Thunderdome!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.68,0:27:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen on! Listen on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the truth of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,争执将引发杀戮 杀戮将引发战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting leads to killing, and killing gets to warring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.71,0:27:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将让我们濒临死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was damn near the death of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.44,0:27:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我们现在 一片毁灭 每个人日子过得苦不堪言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us now, busted up and everyone talking about hard rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.56,0:27:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们很清楚 巴特镇已学到许多教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've learned by the dust of them all. Bartertown's learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 当有人对质斗争 就在此地开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now when men get to fighting, it happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在此地结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it finishes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.67,0:27:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.91,0:28:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我有两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, I've got two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.61,0:28:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个充满恐惧的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men with a gut full of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士 男孩和女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡时间已来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dying time's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.55,0:28:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是毁灭王 杀人机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the ball cracker. Death on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.22,0:28:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们熟知他 你们爱他 他是爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him. You love him! He's Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.53,0:29:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战者来自荒野国度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The challenger, direct from out of the Wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.46,0:29:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他够狠 够帅 够疯狂 他是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bad. He's beautiful. He's crazy! it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.28,0:29:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the man with no name!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.88,0:30:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电擂台很简单 选择武器 任意使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunderdome's simple. Get to the weapons, use them anyway you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们不会达反规定 因为没有任何规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't break the rules. There aren't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.44,0:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你们所在之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是闪电擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Thunderdome.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.90,0:30:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡正在聆听 它将带走第一个尖叫的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is listening, and will take the first man that screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.69,0:30:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.05,0:30:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter, one man leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.17,0:31:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.95,0:32:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸王 爆炸王 爆炸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaster, Blaster, Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:34:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.42,0:35:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him, kill him, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他 - 杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill him! - Kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.19,0:36:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很清楚法律规定 - 这里是闪电擂台\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know the law! - This is Thunderdome!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.70,0:36:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.61,0:36:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 瞧瞧他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Look at his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.62,0:36:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一颗童稚的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the mind of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.17,0:36:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸王 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaster, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.26,0:36:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没包括在我们的协定里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,协定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.05,0:36:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「协定」 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "deal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.47,0:36:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定感受到了 你刚才掌握了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have tasted it. It was in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.68,0:36:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你原本可以赢的 - 我在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had it all! - I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 「协定」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "deal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.36,0:36:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再给你们沼气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more methane!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.51,0:36:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.21,0:36:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 小矮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏才刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.58,0:36:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.84,0:37:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.55,0:37:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.27,0:37:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.11,0:37:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter. One man leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.98,0:37:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter. One man leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.65,0:37:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人进 一人出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men enter. One man leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.44,0:37:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.11,0:38:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,算什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为我不懂法律？当初不是我写的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I don't know the law? Wasn't it me who wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.26,0:38:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说这个人违反了法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say that this man has broken the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.21,0:38:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是对是错 我们已谈好协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right or wrong, we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律规定：「破坏协定 面对大法轮」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the law says, "Bust a deal, face the wheel."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.79,0:38:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏协定 面对大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust a deal and face the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.30,0:38:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏协定面对大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust a deal, face the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.13,0:38:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏协定面对大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust a deal, face the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏协定面对大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust a deal, face the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏协定面对大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust a deal, face the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.39,0:38:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的性命千钧一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our lives hang by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.98,0:38:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有个人等候被判刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we've got a man waiting for sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.68,0:38:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当你想和法律过招时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ain't it the truth? You take your chances with the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.73,0:38:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义就像掷骰子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice is only a roll of the dice…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢铜板或是转大法轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a flip of the coin, a turn of the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.50,0:39:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中营 集中营 集中营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gulag. Gulag. Gulag.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.59,0:41:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇由你掌管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.22,0:41:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.73,0:41:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.13,0:41:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要猪 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not pigs! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.13,0:41:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.72,0:42:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想利用他还是杀了他？把他弄上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to use him or kill him? Bring him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.19,0:42:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 照铁人的话做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, do what lronbar says.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.15,0:42:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh… I Will. Yeah, I Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.04,0:48:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎凡娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savannah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.09,0:48:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.92,0:48:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him. I finded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是沃克机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Captain Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.68,0:49:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说什么？- 他还没说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's his talk? - He ain't made no wordstuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.45,0:49:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,长途跋涉 或许他累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long track. Maybe he's burned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.25,0:49:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他正在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Maybe he's just listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.03,0:49:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克？哈罗？沃克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker? Hello? Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.86,0:49:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他正在说话 只是我们听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's talking, but we ain't hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.25,0:49:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他的嘴唇没动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see his lips ain't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.99,0:49:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是用说话 是用音波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with wordstuff, with sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.40,0:49:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本不可能 音波根本就是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't never gonna work, sonic-bonic bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.33,0:49:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里 三角州狐狸X光\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here's Delta-Fox-X-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.01,0:49:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,三角州狐狸X光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta-Fox-X-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.59,0:49:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.76,0:49:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.23,0:49:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗 沃克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read me, Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.81,0:49:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,三角州狐狸X光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta-Fox-X-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.65,0:49:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.70,0:49:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.58,0:50:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗 沃克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.21,0:50:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样啊 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, what's up, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.75,0:50:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 带我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.26,0:50:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗 沃克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞啊 沃克 - 飞啊 沃克 飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fly, Walker! - Fly, Walker, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.78,0:51:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞啊 沃克 飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly, Walker, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.78,0:51:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞啊 沃克 飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly, Walker, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.86,0:51:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.49,0:52:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？你们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.46,0:52:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.89,0:52:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 安静 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet! Quiet! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.20,0:52:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.28,0:52:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.00,0:52:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.06,0:52:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 够了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.66,0:52:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.00,0:52:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？你们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.29,0:52:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是等候的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We's the waiting ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.91,0:52:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.46,0:53:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你… 等你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you. For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.26,0:53:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.97,0:53:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他在测试我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he be testing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.88,0:53:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是场测试 沃克 你以为我们都在偷懒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This a testing, Walker? You reckon we been slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.69,0:53:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许你们这阵子都很偷懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know. Maybe you've been slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.44,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才没有 我们把它照顾得很好 都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't. We kept it straight. It's all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.59,0:53:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都做了记号 一切都记住了 你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything marked, everything 'membered. You wait, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.12,0:53:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道 我是首位长征者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This you knows. I be First Tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.57,0:53:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在应该由我阐述故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And times past count I done the Tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.67,0:53:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不是我找到沃克 而是莎凡娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it weren't me that tumbled Walker. It was Savannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.85,0:53:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以应该由她负责述说这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's only right that she take the Tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.39,0:53:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一个人故事 这是我们大家的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't one body's story. It's the story of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.83,0:53:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们口述传承历史 你们必须仔细听并牢记\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it mouth-to-mouth. You got to listen it and 'member.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.09,0:54:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们今天听到的故事 明天将要转述给下一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what you hears today you got to tell the birthed tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.15,0:54:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看的 是我们的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking behind us now…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.76,0:54:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很久很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…across the count of time…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.97,0:54:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在古老历史渊远深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…down the long haul, into history back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.27,0:54:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到末日的开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sees the end what were the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.52,0:54:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是大毁灭 充满痛苦折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Pox-Eclipse, full of pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.35,0:54:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那场毁灭中诞生了漫天尘灰 以及恐惧时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And out of it were birthed crackling dust and fearsome time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.38,0:54:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是寒冷的冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It were full-on winter…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.38,0:54:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神对每个人都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Mr. Dead chasing them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.81,0:54:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但死神唯一逮不到的就是沃克机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one he couldn't catch. That were Captain Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.90,0:54:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他召集一群人 然后飞向天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gathers up a gang, takes to the air and flies the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.49,0:54:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们远离家园 向高褛大厦告别 说拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they left their homes, said bidey-bye to the high-scrapers…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.49,0:54:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bidey-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.70,0:54:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把所有知识留在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and what were left of the knowing, they left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.52,0:55:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说风被搅拌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say the wind just stoppered.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.54,0:55:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说那是所谓的乱流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others reckon it were a gang called Turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.93,0:55:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在坠机之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after the wreck…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.76,0:55:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人被死神带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…some had been jumped by Mr. Dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.36,0:55:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些人比较幸运 辗转漂流到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but some had got the luck, and it leads them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.07,0:55:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看了这里 感觉这里就像他们所谓的「地球」\N{\fnArial\fs30}One look and they's got the hots for it. They word it "Planet Earth."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.56,0:55:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 「我们不需要知识 我们可以住在这里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they says, "We don't need the knowing. We can live here."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.38,0:55:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们不需要知识 我们可以住在这里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We don't need the knowing. We can live here."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.64,0:55:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时光不断流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time counts and keeps counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.33,0:55:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始怀念他们的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gets missing what they had.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.42,0:55:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很寂寞 非常怀念高楼大厦以及录影带\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get so lonely for the high-scrapers and the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.56,0:55:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,录影带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.01,0:55:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拍照片 以便记住曾经孰知的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they do pictures so they'd 'member all the knowing they lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Member this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.60,0:56:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow-morrow Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.40,0:56:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,记的这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Member this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.25,0:56:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,光之河\N{\fnArial\fs30}The River of Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.21,0:56:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Member this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空之船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skyraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.01,0:56:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Member this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.45,0:56:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Walker!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.69,0:56:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得这个吗？- 沃克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'Member this? - Mrs. Walker!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.05,0:56:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克机长从长途班机中 挑选几个年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Captain Walker picked them of an age and good for a long haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.05,0:56:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共二十人 这些人大逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They counted twenty, and that were them. The great leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.17,0:56:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「救援队伍一破晓便出发」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rescue party departed at first light…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.60,0:56:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「由班机机长沃克带领」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…led by Flight Captain G.L. Walker."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.77,0:56:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「求神垂怜我们的灵魂」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"May God have mercy on our souls."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.32,0:56:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 跟下一代道别说拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said bidey-bye to them what they'd birthed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.42,0:56:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间 他们回头望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from out of the nothing they looked back…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.91,0:56:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克机长大喊：「等等 我们其中一个会来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Captain Walker hollered, "Wait, one of us will come."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.39,0:57:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「等等 我们其中一个会来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wait, one of us will come."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.58,0:57:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个人果真来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody did come.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.09,0:57:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.00,0:57:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们衷心感谢你 沃克机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We's heartful to you, Captain Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.47,0:57:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已准备好了 带我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We's ready now. Take us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.59,0:57:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保持得很好 全部完好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept it straight! It's all there, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.14,0:57:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,每件束西都做了记号 每件事都铭记在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything marked, everything 'membered!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.98,0:57:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你们保存得非常好 你们一点都没有偷懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you kept it real good. You ain't been slack at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.01,0:57:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还等什么？- 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are we waiting for? - That ain't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.39,0:57:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们找错人了 - 别开玩笑了 机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got the wrong guy. - Quit joshing, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.01,0:58:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 快乘风飞行 - 我们要看明日世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, catch the wind. - We got to see Tomorrow-morrow Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.15,0:58:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家 去明日世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home! Tomorrow-morrow Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.36,0:58:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.86,0:58:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有些地方像这样 城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were places like these. Uh, cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.90,0:58:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那种地方叫城市 有许多城市 - 城市 城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were called cities. Lots of them. - Cities. Cities!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.82,0:58:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道许多事情 他们有高楼大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had lots of knowing of a lot of things. They had skyscrapers…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.87,0:58:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 高楼大厦？- 录影带 还有音波…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Skyscrapers? - …videos and they had the sonic…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.19,0:58:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来发生这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, then this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.63,0:58:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生这场… 大毁灭 一切都结束了 再也没有城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, uh… This Pox-Eclipse happened, and it's finished. It isn't there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.67,0:58:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须了解 这里就是你们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to understand that, uh, this is home…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.89,0:58:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有明日世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and there's no Tomorrow Land…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.01,0:58:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我不是沃克机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I ain't Captain Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.63,0:59:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.90,1:01:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经准备好出发了 机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We's loaded and waiting, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.91,1:01:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在风特别强 机长 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the wind up our arse, captain. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.31,1:02:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要一起走？我们要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's coming? We's pulling on a leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.09,1:03:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哪都走不了 别白费力气时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't gonna be no leavings. All that stuff's just jerking time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.34,1:03:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的做法不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We's working it different.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们难道没看到吗？他根本无法赶上那道风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you seen nothing? He couldn't catch the wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.47,1:03:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有所谓的天空之船 没有救援行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There weren't no skyrafting. There ain't gonna be no salvage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.73,1:03:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里便是明日世界 他已经证明给我们看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our Tomorrow-morrow Land. He's proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.78,1:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都被洗脑了 他若不是沃克机长 又是谁呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Program! All of you program. If he ain't Captain Walker, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我们没有两样 他是徒步来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't no different to us, that's who. He slogged it out on foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.25,1:03:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他能到这里 我们便能回得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he can get here, we can get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的个子并没有比我们大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't much bigger than us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.56,1:03:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,副驾驶都办到了 我们为何不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copilot did it. So why can't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.22,1:03:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话 谁要跟我们走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the trick of it. Who's coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.97,1:03:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不… - 横越一片空无？你们难道不记得？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - Across the nothing? Don't you 'member?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.27,1:03:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们当初找到他时 他只剩下半条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you finded him, he were half jumped by Mr. Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人说外面的情况好应付 我们很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's saying it ain't a hard slog. We knows that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.54,1:03:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们若要获得知识做法 就没有简单的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wants the knowing the doing, there ain't no easy ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.83,1:03:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有所谓的知识和做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no knowing and ain't no doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.08,1:03:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有天空之船也没有音波 你们出去闯只是一片空\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no skyraft and there ain't no sonic. You slog out there to nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.52,1:03:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比空无还可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.46,1:03:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们首先会遏到 一个龌龊的地方 叫巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first place you'll find is a sleaze pit called Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.98,1:04:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们没被大地吞噬 保证会被那地方生吞活剥\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the earth doesn't swallow you up, that place sure as hell will.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.25,1:04:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到他说的 没有所谓的明日世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen him! There ain't no Tomorrow-morrow Land!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.22,1:04:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经听过他说的话 全是一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We done that! He's got wordstuff from his ass to his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.69,1:04:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上有果汁的人 跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever's got the juice, track with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.69,1:04:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.72,1:05:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 给我听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen good!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.69,1:05:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是沃克机长 我是个不畏惧死神的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Captain Walker. I'm the guy who keeps Mr. Dead in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.90,1:05:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们应该 留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say we're gonna stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.74,1:05:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会活到长命百岁 我们将心存感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna live a long time and we're gonna be thankful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.74,1:05:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep tracking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.38,1:06:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,史雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slake!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.80,1:06:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去把其他人带回来 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the others. - Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.87,1:07:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了 你得去把他们找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've gone. You got to get them back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.33,1:07:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 他们走了 史古鲁斯放他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! They've gone! Scrooloose let them go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.82,1:07:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎凡娜带走他们 他们走进沙漠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savannah's taken them. They're in the nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.91,1:07:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你必须帮我 你必须帮我把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you got to help me! Come, you got to help me get them back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.55,1:07:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎凡娜和盖可 他根本没办法走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savannah and Gekko. He can hardly walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.59,1:07:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小芬恩 天鱼先生和库莎 她随时就要生孩子了 还有副驾驶…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Finn, Mr. Skyfish, and Cusha. She's gonna pop any day now. And Copilot…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.97,1:07:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.21,1:08:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走了多远？- 半个夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long? - Half a night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.84,1:08:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许更短 他们已深入沙漠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe less. They be deep in the nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.33,1:08:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没带太多水 - 无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ain't got much water. - Makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.02,1:08:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会被沙子吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be swallowed by the sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.22,1:08:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把他们带回来 机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get them back, captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.27,1:08:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一直叫我机长 别一直发出那种声音 别鬼叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop with the "Captain." Stop. Stop the noise, will you? Stop the noise!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.90,1:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要愈多水愈好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need as much water as I can carry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.49,1:08:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.01,1:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要替我的朋友们展开救援行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I's coming salvage for my buddies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.33,1:08:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needs a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.22,1:10:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己可以 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He holds his own, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.00,1:11:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.13,1:13:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.56,1:13:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, let's trek!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.20,1:13:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是明日世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it Tomorrow-morrow Land?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.44,1:13:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.04,1:13:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.88,1:13:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 我们随后就进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in, we're right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.21,1:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 大家跟紧一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Stick together!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.78,1:13:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.14,1:13:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么都看不到 - 这里是巴特镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see nothing. - It's Bartertown.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.57,1:13:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.26,1:14:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐巴 厍莎 等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tubba, Cusha, wait up! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.64,1:14:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.48,1:14:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,往光亮处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.36,1:14:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人呢？- 他们在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are the others? - They've gone ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.18,1:14:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多远？- 非常远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far? - A long way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.92,1:14:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看得到他们吗？- 一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you see them? - Only just!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.41,1:14:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做什么？我们有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing? What's our program?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.98,1:14:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.67,1:14:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里？你在开玩笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here? This is jerking time!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.12,1:14:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个矮子 他知道很多事情 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little guy, got the knowing of a lot of things. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.87,1:14:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 明白就闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah, well, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.87,1:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,会看到什么 机长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to see, captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.81,1:14:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.98,1:14:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 机长 那个小矮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him, captain! It's the little guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.17,1:14:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮？我看他是全世界最小的人 搞什么？机长 他有啥用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little? He's the smallest! What the fuck, captain. What use is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.66,1:15:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他人呢？- 在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are the others? - Out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.97,1:16:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,史古伊 咱们飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwy, let's fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.59,1:16:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.23,1:16:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.27,1:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.98,1:17:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.73,1:17:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 无论你去哪里 你总是在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, no matter where you go, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.80,1:18:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.92,1:19:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.81,1:20:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.02,1:20:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.52,1:21:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,先追人 晚点再付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase now, pay later.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.22,1:22:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartertown! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.05,1:22:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.55,1:22:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴特镇 - 注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bartertown! - Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.92,1:22:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算跑去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you gonna run?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.41,1:22:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算躲在哪里？听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you gonna hide? Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.39,1:22:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴特镇将存活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartertown will live!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.07,1:22:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小矮子找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the little man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.10,1:22:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他活捉回来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him back to me alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.46,1:22:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将重新改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Will rebuild!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.57,1:22:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不宽恕把他带走的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those who took him, no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.50,1:23:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.92,1:23:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.96,1:23:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.86,1:23:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天鱼 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skyfish, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.28,1:24:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.50,1:24:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是音波\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.04,1:24:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖可找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gekko got it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.04,1:24:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是三角州狐狸X光\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Delta-Fox-X-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.67,1:24:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三角州狐狸X光 - 请回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delta-Fox-X-Ray. - Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.46,1:24:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到我吗？完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.40,1:24:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回应 你能听到我吗？三角州狐狸X光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in. Do you read me? Delta-Fox-X-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.43,1:24:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回应 完毕 你能听到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, over. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.40,1:24:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎收听 请打开书本看第一页\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. Open your book at page one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.20,1:24:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请跟我念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.74,1:24:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.37,1:24:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.46,1:24:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.76,1:24:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里？- 你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.80,1:25:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.35,1:25:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要回家 - 我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am going home. - I am going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.02,1:25:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.87,1:25:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把那个人抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the man!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.91,1:27:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀猪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Pigkiller!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.71,1:27:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.96,1:29:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑手指 拔掉栓钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackfinger! Pull the pin!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.26,1:29:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.51,1:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 黑手指 抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, Blackfinger! Hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.82,1:29:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.91,1:29:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他还来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.85,1:29:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.83,1:29:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑手指 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackfinger, let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.20,1:29:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱住你了 我们要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you now. We're going home!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.54,1:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.29,1:30:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.13,1:30:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.92,1:31:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna count to three.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.25,1:31:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.13,1:31:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,二呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to two?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.03,1:31:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a stickup!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.41,1:31:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人敢动的话就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody moves, and they're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.71,1:31:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们都完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think we're all dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.38,1:32:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我们完蛋了 我们完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad! We're dead meat! We're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.09,1:32:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 我们完蛋了 - 好的 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! We're dead meat! - Okay, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.55,1:32:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点上飞机 - 好了 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quick, get in the plane! - Okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.14,1:32:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.68,1:32:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我警告过你了 老爸 - 快跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I warned you, Dad! - Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.23,1:32:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.62,1:33:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你走运的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. It's your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.36,1:33:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.09,1:33:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一架飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.62,1:33:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.75,1:33:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它或许能救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might just save your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.58,1:33:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It Will? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.61,1:33:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 起飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.04,1:33:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.91,1:33:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.54,1:33:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna get off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.79,1:33:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机超重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're overloaded!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.62,1:34:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 快想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you better do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.91,1:35:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还等什么 快点发动 - 没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kick her in the guts. - Not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.81,1:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道不够长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not enough runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.07,1:35:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't got any choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.87,1:35:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between them…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.24,1:35:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们之间 跑道不够长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and us, there's not enough runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.46,1:35:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,会够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.40,1:36:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agh!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.12,1:38:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.90,1:38:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩可真是旗鼓相当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't we a pair…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.50,1:38:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,邋遢男\N{\fnArial\fs30}…raggedy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.18,1:38:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会 战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.43,1:40:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知晓 岁月如梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}This you knows. The years travel fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.35,1:40:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一再重复述说故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And time after time, I've done the Tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.72,1:40:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一个人的故事 这是我们大家的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ain't one body's Tell. It's the Tell of us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.26,1:40:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听了以后必须记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got to listen it and 'member.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.28,1:40:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们今天听到的故事 明天将转述给下一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause what you hears today, you got to tell the newborn tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.67,1:40:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看的是我们的过去历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I's looking behind us now, into history back.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.12,1:40:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那些幸运儿有机会 远渡重洋返回家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sees those of us that got the luck and started the haul for home.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.50,1:40:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得当初如何来到此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I 'members how it lead us here…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.37,1:40:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们心存感激 因为我们看到从前的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and how we was heartful because we seen what there once was.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.70,1:40:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要看一眼 我们便了解一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}One look, and we knewed we'd got it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.55,1:41:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在我们之前的人 所知道和所做的一切全超乎我们理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those what had gone before had knowing of things beyond our reckoning…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.52,1:41:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们连做梦也想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even beyond our dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.56,1:41:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,光阴不停地流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time counts and keeps counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.53,1:41:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we knows now…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.56,1:41:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找失落的事物 过程并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}…finding the trick of what's been and lost ain't no easy ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.36,1:41:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我们的路 我们的必经之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's our track. We got to travel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.82,1:41:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道它将带领我们前往何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there ain't nobody knows where it's gonna lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.91,1:41:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 我们每天晚上仍叙说故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still and all, every night we does the Tell…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.07,1:41:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们 记得自己的身份和来处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that we 'member who we was and where we came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.87,1:41:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们最记得的是那发现我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all we 'members the man who finded us…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.96,1:41:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领救援行动的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…him that came the salvage.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.46,1:41:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们点亮城市 不仅是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we lights the city. Not just for him…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.09,1:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是给所有仍在外面努力的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but for all of them that are still out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.23,1:41:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们知道将来会有一晚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we knows there'll come a night…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.12,1:41:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们看到远处的灯光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when they sees the distant light…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.68,1:41:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将能返回家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and they'll be coming home.
